brating the Solstice Festival and it is bustling with activity. Red and his friends are enjoying the festival, but they come across a fight between some young people.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2XMj3OKZ9LjX2iFaPMISkxvJ7XG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2XMj3OKZ9LjX2iFaPMISkxvJ7XG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113256/season/2/episode/3"},{"id":"4963946","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It's morning as usual. Ruti reconsiders her ordinary daily life that she had abandoned as a hero. That morning, Tisse seemed to be acting strangely. Ruti tries to ask her about the previous night, but...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.214,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uHFIvKvMIgpLfQiIeQNA4HLJbB2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uHFIvKvMIgpLfQiIeQNA4HLJbB2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113256/season/2/episode/4"},{"id":"4963948","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Danan, who's been undergoing medical treatment, is on the mend. Before leaving town, Danan asks to arrange a deal with Red. Red readily accepts and a special training camp with the former hero party commences.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.056,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oXW4qfTkGtgXIT5DAKRrKzLifeW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oXW4qfTkGtgXIT5DAKRrKzLifeW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/113256/season/2/episode/5"},{"id":"4963949","seasonNumber":2,"